  "reference": "Amos 7",
  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "AMO 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I had a vision from the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". In it I saw him create a swarm of locusts just after the king's share of the hay had been cut and the grass was starting to grow again. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In my vision I saw the locusts eat up every green thing in the land, and then I said, “Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", forgive your people! How can they survive? They are so small and weak!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " changed his mind and said, “What you saw will not take place.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I had another vision from the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". In it I saw him preparing to punish his people with fire. The fire burnt up the great ocean under the earth, and started to burn up the land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I said, “Stop, Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "! How can your people survive? They are so small and weak!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " changed his mind again and said, “This will not take place either.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I had another vision from the Lord. In it I saw him standing beside a wall that had been built with the help of a plumb line, and there was a plumb line in his hand. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He asked me, “Amos, what do you see?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“A plumb line,” I answered.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he said, “I am using it to show that my people are like a wall that is out of line. I will not change my mind again about punishing them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The places where Isaac's descendants worship will be destroyed. The holy places of Israel will be left in ruins. I will bring the dynasty of King Jeroboam to an end.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaziah, the priest of Bethel, then sent a report to King Jeroboam of Israel: “Amos is plotting against you among the people. His speeches will destroy the country. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what he says: ‘Jeroboam will die in battle, and the people of Israel will be taken away from their land into exile.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaziah then said to Amos, “That's enough, prophet! Go on back to Judah and do your preaching there. Let ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " pay you for it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't prophesy here at Bethel any more. This is the king's place of worship, the national temple.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amos answered, “I am not the kind of prophet who prophesies for pay. I am a herdsman, and I take care of fig trees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " took me from my work as a shepherd and ordered me to come and prophesy to his people Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So now listen to what the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says. You tell me to stop prophesying, to stop raving against the people of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And so, Amaziah, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says to you, ‘Your wife will become a prostitute on the streets, and your children will be killed in war. Your land will be divided up and given to others, and you yourself will die in a heathen country. And the people of Israel will certainly be taken away from their own land into exile.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
